<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower on Thursday in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 57.40 to 6820.28.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.81 to 411.78.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.19.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1526 to 949.</p>
<p>Volume was 496,861,340 compared with 535,552,530 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
